<style>
.insight-section {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 100%;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 44px 42px;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    color: #2d3a5a;
    background:
        radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(228, 233, 245, 0.85), transparent 34%),
        radial-gradient(circle at bottom right, rgba(245, 247, 252, 0.95), transparent 32%),
        linear-gradient(135deg, #fbfcff 0%, #f7f9fd 48%, #f3f6fb 100%);
    border-radius: 28px;
    box-shadow: 0 30px 70px rgba(31, 42, 68, 0.10);
    border: 1px solid rgba(227, 231, 240, 0.9);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-sizing: border-box;
}

.insight-section::before,
.insight-section::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    border-radius: 50%;
    pointer-events: none;
}

.insight-section::before {
    width: 340px;
    height: 340px;
    top: -140px;
    right: -90px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(117, 138, 185, 0.18) 0%, rgba(117, 138, 185, 0) 72%);
    filter: blur(6px);
    animation: floatOrb 10s ease-in-out infinite;
}

.insight-section::after {
    width: 280px;
    height: 280px;
    bottom: -120px;
    left: -80px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(215, 223, 242, 0.65) 0%, rgba(215, 223, 242, 0) 72%);
    filter: blur(6px);
    animation: floatOrb 12s ease-in-out infinite reverse;
}

/* HEADLINES */
.insight-title {
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 25px;
    color: #1f2a44;
}

/* SUB LABELS */
.insight-label {
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-top: 25px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    color: #1f2a44;
}

/* TEXT */
.insight-text {
    font-size: 15.5px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
}

/* LIST BOXES */
.insight-box {
    background: #f4f6fb;
    border: 1px solid #e3e7f0;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
}

/* ARROW */
.arrow {
    font-weight: 600;
}

/* INSIGHT HIGHLIGHT */
.insight-highlight {
    margin-top: 20px;
    padding: 20px;
    background: #f9fafc;
    border-left: 4px solid #1f2a44;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-size: 15.5px;
    line-height: 1.8;
}

/* STRONG LINE */
.insight-strong {
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
}

.insight-hero {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-end;
    gap: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 34px;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
}

.insight-kicker {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    padding: 7px 14px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgba(31, 42, 68, 0.06);
    border: 1px solid rgba(31, 42, 68, 0.08);
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #1f2a44;
}

.insight-main-title {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    font-size: 40px;
    line-height: 1.12;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: #16213d;
}

.insight-subtitle {
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: #5a6787;
}

.insight-summary {
    min-width: 240px;
    padding: 18px 20px;
    border-radius: 18px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);
    border: 1px solid rgba(227, 231, 240, 0.9);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(31, 42, 68, 0.07);
}

.insight-summary-label {
    font-size: 12px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    color: #7884a3;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
}

.insight-summary-value {
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #1f2a44;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
}

.insight-summary-text {
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #5a6787;
}

.insight-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 26px;
    align-items: start;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
}

.insight-card {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: 28px;
    border-radius: 24px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.80);
    border: 1px solid rgba(227, 231, 240, 0.95);
    box-shadow: 0 22px 55px rgba(31, 42, 68, 0.08);
    transition: transform 0.45s ease, box-shadow 0.45s ease, border-color 0.45s ease;
}

.insight-card::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0 0 auto 0;
    height: 4px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #1f2a44, #5b6c95, #dfe5f1);
}

.insight-card::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    right: -40px;
    bottom: -50px;
    width: 190px;
    height: 190px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(113, 132, 176, 0.12) 0%, rgba(113, 132, 176, 0) 72%);
    transition: transform 0.45s ease, opacity 0.45s ease;
    opacity: 0.85;
}

.insight-card > * {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
}

.insight-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-8px);
    box-shadow: 0 30px 64px rgba(31, 42, 68, 0.13);
    border-color: rgba(201, 211, 232, 1);
}

.insight-card:hover::after {
    transform: scale(1.08);
}

.insight-case-tag {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 7px 14px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: #f3f6fb;
    border: 1px solid #e3e7f0;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #46557a;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
}

.insight-media {
    margin-top: 22px;
    border-radius: 18px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid rgba(227, 231, 240, 0.9);
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e9edf6 0%, #dce4f2 100%);
    box-shadow: 0 18px 35px rgba(31, 42, 68, 0.10);
    transition: transform 0.45s ease, box-shadow 0.45s ease;
}

.insight-media img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 500px;
    object-fit: cover;
    transform: scale(1.01);
    transition: transform 0.85s ease;
}

.insight-media:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: 0 24px 48px rgba(31, 42, 68, 0.15);
}

.insight-media:hover img {
    transform: scale(1.05);
}

.insight-media-caption {
    padding: 16px 18px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #4f5e82;
}

.insight-conclusion {
    margin-top: 28px;
    padding: 26px 28px;
    border-radius: 22px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1f2a44 0%, #2f4065 100%);
    color: #ffffff;
    box-shadow: 0 24px 50px rgba(31, 42, 68, 0.18);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
}

.insight-conclusion::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(120deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) 38%);
    pointer-events: none;
}

.insight-conclusion .insight-strong,
.insight-conclusion .insight-text {
    color: #ffffff;
}

.insight-reveal {
    animation: premiumEntrance 0.9s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1) both;
}

.insight-reveal-delay-1 {
    animation-delay: 0.08s;
}

.insight-reveal-delay-2 {
    animation-delay: 0.16s;
}

.insight-reveal-delay-3 {
    animation-delay: 0.24s;
}

@keyframes premiumEntrance {
    from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(28px) scale(0.985);
    }
    to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0) scale(1);
    }
}

@keyframes floatOrb {
    0%, 100% {
        transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0);
    }
    50% {
        transform: translate3d(0, 18px, 0);
    }
}

@media (max-width: 960px) {
    .insight-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .insight-hero {
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: flex-start;
    }

    .insight-summary {
        width: 100%;
    }
}

@media (max-width: 640px) {
    .insight-section {
        padding: 24px 18px;
        border-radius: 20px;
    }

    .insight-main-title {
        font-size: 30px;
    }

    .insight-card {
        padding: 20px;
        border-radius: 18px;
    }

    .insight-media img {
        height: 320px;
    }
}
</style>

<div class="insight-section">
    <div class="insight-hero insight-reveal">
        <div>
            <div class="insight-kicker">Inside-Out Thinking</div>
            <h1 class="insight-main-title">Insights shaped through strategy, leadership, and reinvention.</h1>
            <p class="insight-subtitle">
                Two parallel perspectives that reveal the same deeper truth: the most resilient growth happens when direction is built from inherent strength, not external noise.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="insight-summary insight-reveal insight-reveal-delay-1">
            <div class="insight-summary-label">Core Theme</div>
            <div class="insight-summary-value">Build Within</div>
            <div class="insight-summary-text">
                A premium point of view on brands, leadership, and decisions that last longer than trends.
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="insight-grid">
        <div class="insight-card insight-reveal insight-reveal-delay-1">
            <div class="insight-case-tag">Case 01 • Brands & Businesses</div>

            <div class="insight-title">
                An insight from practice – Brands & Businesses
            </div>

            <div class="insight-label">Context</div>
            <div class="insight-text">
                A fashion brand planning to operate in the streetwear category, driven by market trends and short-term design cycles.
            </div>

            <div class="insight-label">The Problem</div>
            <div class="insight-box">A crowded market</div>
            <div class="insight-box">Dependence on trends</div>
            <div class="insight-box">Weak differentiation</div>

            <div class="insight-label">The Shift</div>
            <div class="insight-text">
                Moved from trend-led positioning to a premium fabric-led brand narrative
            </div>

            <div class="insight-text insight-strong">This involved:</div>
            <div class="insight-box">Reframing core strength</div>
            <div class="insight-box">Elevating product storytelling</div>
            <div class="insight-box">Aligning communication with premium identity</div>

            <div class="insight-label">The Outcome</div>
            <div class="insight-text">
                Shifted from competing on trends <span class="arrow">→</span> to competing on substance and positioning
            </div>

            <div class="insight-media">
                <img src="https://jitinthapar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/speaking-1-237x300.jpeg" alt="Premium fashion brand insight visual">
                <div class="insight-media-caption">
                    Repositioning becomes premium when the story is anchored in what the business can consistently deliver, not just what the market currently rewards.
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="insight-label">The Insight</div>
            <div class="insight-highlight">
                <div class="insight-strong">
                    The strongest position a brand can build is when its business strategy is anchored in the core strength it is inherently equipped to deliver.
                </div>

                <div class="insight-text">
                    In many cases, brands shape their strategy by looking outward - responding to market trends, competition and short-term opportunities.
                </div>

                <div class="insight-text">
                    However, the most resilient brands operate differently.
                </div>

                <div class="insight-text insight-strong">
                    They build inside-out.
                </div>

                <div class="insight-text">
                    By aligning their positioning with what they can consistently deliver at a fundamental level, they reduce dependence on market fluctuations and create a more stable, defensible path to growth.
                </div>

                <div class="insight-text">
                    Because when a brand operates from its inherent strength, shifts in trends do not disrupt direction, they reinforce it.
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="insight-card insight-reveal insight-reveal-delay-2">
            <div class="insight-case-tag">Case 02 • Leadership & Reinvention</div>

            <div class="insight-title">
                An insight shaped through Leadership and Personal Reinvention
            </div>

            <div class="insight-label">Context</div>
            <div class="insight-text">
                Across his leadership roles and career transitions, Jitin Thapar experienced both sides of growth - operating within structured environments and stepping into moments of uncertainty while redefining direction.
            </div>

            <div class="insight-text">
                These transitions were not always linear.
            </div>

            <div class="insight-text">
                They involved moving across roles, expanding capability, and at times, stepping away from familiarity to build a clearer understanding of where he was headed.
            </div>

            <div class="insight-label">The Realisation</div>

            <div class="insight-text insight-strong">In organizations:</div>
            <div class="insight-box">Leadership was often exercised through authority, not clarity</div>
            <div class="insight-box">Decisions were driven by pressure, not direction</div>

            <div class="insight-text insight-strong" style="margin-top:15px;">And in careers:</div>
            <div class="insight-box">Growth was happening, but without a defined identity</div>
            <div class="insight-box">Opportunities were being pursued, without understanding long-term alignment</div>

            <div class="insight-label">The Conflict</div>
            <div class="insight-text">Capability was not the problem.</div>
            <div class="insight-text">Effort was not the problem.</div>
            <div class="insight-text insight-strong">The absence of clarity of identity was.</div>

            <div class="insight-label">The Shift</div>
            <div class="insight-text">
                A different approach began to take shape. One that reversed the starting point.
            </div>

            <div class="insight-text insight-strong">Instead of asking:</div>
            <div class="insight-box">"What is the next opportunity?"</div>

            <div class="insight-text insight-strong">The question became:</div>
            <div class="insight-box">"What is the core strength and direction this should be built on?"</div>

            <div class="insight-text insight-strong">This applied equally to:</div>
            <div class="insight-box">Leadership → defining how one leads before exercising authority</div>
            <div class="insight-box">Careers → understanding one’s axis before making decisions</div>

            <div class="insight-label">The Outcome</div>
            <div class="insight-text">Leadership became more consistent and authentic.</div>
            <div class="insight-text">Decisions became clearer and not reactive.</div>
            <div class="insight-text">Career moves became intentional and fulfilling.</div>

            <div class="insight-label">The Insight</div>
            <div class="insight-highlight">
                <div class="insight-strong">The Insight (Leadership):</div>
                <div class="insight-text">
                    The most effective leadership emerges when it is grounded in one’s authentic self, not shaped by borrowed styles or defined by positional authority.
                </div>

                <div class="insight-text">
                    Leaders begin to operate under pressure - to perform, to conform, or to replicate.
                </div>

                <div class="insight-text">
                    Authentic leadership removes this friction.
                </div>

                <div class="insight-text">
                    Because the leader is no longer performing leadership, they are operating from it.
                </div>

                <br>

                <div class="insight-strong">The Insight (Career):</div>
                <div class="insight-text">
                    Career reinvention becomes more stable when it is built inside-out.
                </div>

                <div class="insight-text">
                    When individuals align with their inherent strengths:
                </div>

                <div class="insight-box">Transitions become more intentional</div>
                <div class="insight-box">Learning becomes faster and more relevant</div>
                <div class="insight-box">Confidence becomes internal and not situational</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="insight-conclusion insight-highlight insight-reveal insight-reveal-delay-3">
        <div class="insight-strong">
            When leadership and careers are built from within,
        </div>
        <div class="insight-text">
            external shifts, whether market changes or technological disruptions, do not weaken direction.
        </div>
        <div class="insight-text insight-strong">
            They strengthen it.
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<script>
document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", function() {
    const elements = document.querySelectorAll(
        ".insight-card, .insight-box, .insight-text, .insight-label, .insight-highlight, .insight-media, .insight-summary"
    );

    const observer = new IntersectionObserver(entries => {
        entries.forEach(entry => {
            if (entry.isIntersecting) {
                entry.target.style.opacity = 1;
                entry.target.style.transform = "translateY(0)";
                entry.target.style.filter = "blur(0)";
            }
        });
    }, { threshold: 0.1 });

    elements.forEach((el, index) => {
        el.style.opacity = 0;
        el.style.transform = "translateY(24px)";
        el.style.filter = "blur(8px)";
        el.style.transition = "all 0.75s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1)";
        el.style.transitionDelay = (index % 6) * 0.05 + "s";
        observer.observe(el);
    });
});
</script>
